+      "title": "What you already know",
+      "content": "You know *creo que* + indicative and *no creo que* + subjunctive from B1 Unit 7. Historians disagree about why revolutions happen, so this lesson is full of opinions. Here you use the present tense: *Algunos historiadores creen que la desigualdad es la causa*; *otros no creen que la pobreza explique una revolución*."
